{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天做一件事",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 60.34,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "按角色，各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 1.695,
   "speechEnd": 3.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "交易所和跨链桥，列出每个资金决策读取的数据源，去掉重复的运营方，看剩下几个。",
   "spoken": "交易所和跨链桥，列出每个资金决策读取的数据源，去掉虫复的运营方，看剩下几个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.9,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 3.9,
   "speechEnd": 11.755
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "节点运维，确认 RPC 和 Engine API 没有暴露在公网。",
   "spoken": "节点运维，确认 RPC 和 Engine API 没有暴露在公网。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 12.2,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 12.2,
   "speechEnd": 16.433
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "验证者团队，把故障切换改成人工确认，原实例停止之后，才启动备用。",
   "spoken": "验证者团队，把故障切换改成人工确认，原实例停止之后，才启动备用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 16.82,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 16.911,
   "speechEnd": 22.568
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "普通用户，余额显示异常时，换一个 RPC 或区块浏览器交叉确认。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，余额显示异常时，换一个 RPC 或区块浏览器交叉确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 22.96,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 22.96,
   "speechEnd": 28.55
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "自定义 RPC，只添加官方文档列出的地址。",
   "spoken": "自定义 RPC，只添加官方文档列出的地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 29.02,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 29.02,
   "speechEnd": 32.563
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 33.0,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 33.0,
   "speechEnd": 34.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "监控查询的是同一个节点，看到的是真实数据，它无法发现这次攻击。",
   "spoken": "监控查询的是同一个节点，看到的是真实数据，它无法发现这次攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 34.58,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 34.58,
   "speechEnd": 39.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "要发现它，需要拿验证者实际收到的结果，和不同运营方的数据源比对。",
   "spoken": "要发现它，需要拿验证者实际收到的结果，和不同运营方的数据源比对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 40.4,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 40.4,
   "speechEnd": 46.284
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "这只在来源真正独立时成立。",
   "spoken": "这只在来源真正独立时成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 46.7,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 46.798,
   "speechEnd": 49.157
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "你读到的链，只是某个节点告诉你的链，先问几家独立的节点，再签名，再入账。",
   "spoken": "你读到的链，只是某个节点告诉你的链，先问几家独立的节点，再签名，再入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 49.56,
